      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-06/020.jpg",
      "imagePrompt": "Parliament members debating while a giant spreadsheet calendar floats behind them, cheese wheels on the table, comic illustration, flat design, purple and yellow colors",
